# JRE runtime edges, one per proven linkage (readelf over every
# shipped binary after the first build; widened or trimmed then):
# freetype+fontconfig (libfontmanager/headless AWT), ca-certificates
# (source bundle for the cacerts hook), cups (java.desktop printing
# links libcups), alsa-lib (libjsound links libasound). The base pin
# is added automatically by the splitter.
freetype
fontconfig
ca-certificates
cups
alsa-lib
